    "longueur_ref": 105,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_4",
    "chrf": 37.74,
    "plancher": 48.38,
    "hasard": 10.77,
    "sortie": "At school, Khalai talk plenty am tree wan dey inside playground sharp sharp. \"Tree呀，这里需要翻译成尼日利亚皮钦语（Nigerian Pidgin），正确的翻译应该是：\n\n\"At school, Khalai talk plenty am tree wan dey inside playground sharp sharp. 'Tree, put out big branch so we fit sit under you shade sharp sharp.'\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 275,
    "longueur_ref": 162,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_5",
    "chrf": 30.9,
    "plancher": 35.26,
    "hasard": 20.11,
    "sortie": "Khalai talk plenty hedg喽，这句话的尼日利亚皮钦语翻译应该是：\"Khalai talk plenty hedge don dey round school body. 'Please grow strong, no let wicked person come inside.'\" 由于之前的表达中出现了不准确的部分（\"hedg喽\"），我将提供一个更正后的完整翻译。",
    "longueur_sortie": 194,
    "longueur_ref": 130,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_6",
    "chrf": 34.26,
    "plancher": 46.04,
    "hasard": 21.14,
    "sortie": "Wen Khalai reach house from school, am go see am chop dey small for tree naa? Khalai ask.",
