    "sortie": "He sat on a tall chair. He came to use a long fork to eat.",
    "longueur_sortie": 58,
    "longueur_ref": 58,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0001_10",
    "chrf": 36.4,
    "plancher": 24.27,
    "hasard": 14.57,
    "sortie": "He left his house to clear some bushes. He is still there.",
    "longueur_sortie": 58,
    "longueur_ref": 69,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0004_0",
    "chrf": 60.82,
    "plancher": 34.92,
    "hasard": 18.91,
    "sortie": "Goat, Dog, and Malu are friends. So one day they went on a trip in a car.",
    "longueur_sortie": 73,
    "longueur_ref": 80,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0004_1",
    "chrf": 45.34,
    "plancher": 28.88,
    "hasard": 30.36,
    "sortie": "When they reached where they were going, it was the driver who asked for money. Malu paid his share.",
    "longueur_sortie": 100,
    "longueur_ref": 104,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0004_2",
    "chrf": 23.61,
    "plancher": 15.92,
    "hasard": 10.77,
    "sortie": "Dog put a little money in, but it's not enough",
    "longueur_sortie": 46,
    "longueur_ref": 64,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0004_3",
    "chrf": 35.66,
    "plancher": 35.0,
    "hasard": 15.22,
    "sortie": "D drive been want give dog change when goat take style run, he no pay oh.",
    "longueur_sortie": 73,
    "longueur_ref": 87,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0004_4",
    "chrf": 27.52,
    "plancher": 28.42,
    "hasard": 15.9,
    "sortie": "The D driver is not easy to deal with, so he didn't let Dog switch places.",
    "longueur_sortie": 74,
    "longueur_ref": 73,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0004_5",
    "chrf": 35.22,
    "plancher": 39.06,
    "hasard": 13.94,
    "sortie": "Until today, they still have to cut off a dog's tail to check if the driver has been replaced inside the car.",
    "longueur_sortie": 109,
    "longueur_ref": 107,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0004_6",
    "chrf": 21.07,
    "plancher": 18.78,
    "hasard": 16.05,
    "sortie": "The goat is on its own level and doesn't try to get close to the motorcycle. It's scared that if they catch it, they'll come to collect the debt it owes.",
    "longueur_sortie": 153,
    "longueur_ref": 99,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0004_7",
    "chrf": 27.07,
    "plancher": 20.72,
    "hasard": 8.2,
    "sortie": "The cow won't send if the car comes or not. It's the walker's responsibility to stay on the road and not owe anyone. \n\nNote: The phrase \"owe anyone\" in this context is an idiomatic expression that likely means \"to blame someone else\" or \"to hold someone responsible.\" A more natural translation might be:\n\n\"The cow won't move whether the car comes or not. It's up to the pedestrian to stay on the road and not blame others.\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 424,
    "longueur_ref": 127,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_0",
    "chrf": 56.67,
    "plancher": 49.62,
    "hasard": 18.44,
    "sortie": "This is Daisy. She is seven years old. The meaning of her name is 'good one' in their dialect, which is Lu Bukusu.",
    "longueur_sortie": 114,
    "longueur_ref": 96,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_1",
    "chrf": 58.37,
    "plancher": 48.03,
    "hasard": 24.31,
    "sortie": "Khalai wakes up and begins with an orange tree. \"Please, orange tree, grow well so that we can eat plenty of oranges when they ripen.\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 134,
    "longueur_ref": 110,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_2",
    "chrf": 32.39,
    "plancher": 40.99,
    "hasard": 20.49,
    "sortie": "The child goes to school on thorns. The path is filled with thorns. \"Please don't grow, stay short so you don't hurt me and I don't die.\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 137,
    "longueur_ref": 105,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_3",
    "chrf": 49.76,
    "plancher": 40.05,
    "hasard": 15.83,
    "sortie": "A lady picked a bush flower. \"Please, oh flower, grow well so that I can put you in my hair.\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 93,
    "longueur_ref": 88,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_4",
    "chrf": 66.24,
    "plancher": 54.04,
    "hasard": 11.6,
    "sortie": "For school, Khalai went to talk to the tree that's in the center of the compound. \"Please, oh tree, can you spread your branches so that we can sit down to read under your shade?\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 179,
    "longueur_ref": 135,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_5",
    "chrf": 43.58,
    "plancher": 41.11,
    "hasard": 18.37,
    "sortie": "The students planted flowers around their school. \"Please let these flowers grow strong so that people won't be able to enter our school.\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 138,
    "longueur_ref": 101,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_6",
    "chrf": 51.95,
    "plancher": 44.18,
    "hasard": 22.58,
    "sortie": "When Wen Khalai came back to school, she went to look at the orange tree and asked it, \"Your oranges aren't ripe yet?\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 118,
    "longueur_ref": 107,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0089_7",
    "chrf": 44.93,
    "plancher": 45.4,
    "hasard": 11.39,
    "sortie": "\"D orange is still not ripe yet.\" hmmmn. \"I'll see you tomorrow, orange tree,\" \"maybe tomorrow I'll go to Beta and get a ripe orange for myself!\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 145,
    "longueur_ref": 147,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_0",
    "chrf": 55.54,
    "plancher": 29.28,
    "hasard": 14.38,
    "sortie": "My little brother sleeps very well. I get up early like a big boy!",
    "longueur_sortie": 66,
    "longueur_ref": 69,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_1",
    "chrf": 15.7,
    "plancher": 20.88,
    "hasard": 15.3,
    "sortie": "Let it be allowed to enter inside.",
    "longueur_sortie": 34,
    "longueur_ref": 33,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_2",
    "chrf": 22.99,
    "plancher": 22.92,
    "hasard": 12.54,
    "sortie": "You be my shine, shine, bobo, mama go say.",
    "longueur_sortie": 42,
    "longueur_ref": 34,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_3",
    "chrf": 29.27,
    "plancher": 29.34,
    "hasard": 11.32,
    "sortie": "I know myself that no one is going to help me.",
    "longueur_sortie": 46,
    "longueur_ref": 37,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_4",
    "chrf": 56.43,
    "plancher": 58.88,
    "hasard": 17.6,
    "sortie": "I'm not afraid of cold water and blue soap when they are smelt",
    "longueur_sortie": 62,
    "longueur_ref": 48,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_5",
    "chrf": 27.56,
    "plancher": 24.99,
    "hasard": 17.75,
    "sortie": "Mama, go tell her not to forget her teeth! I'll tell her not to worry.",
    "longueur_sortie": 70,
    "longueur_ref": 59,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_6",
    "chrf": 47.39,
    "plancher": 33.76,
    "hasard": 13.15,
    "sortie": "When I finish bathing, I go to greet grandpa and aunt, and tell them that today is better.",
    "longueur_sortie": 90,
    "longueur_ref": 68,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_7",
    "chrf": 35.07,
    "plancher": 35.54,
    "hasard": 17.0,
    "sortie": "Then I put on my clothes by myself, \"I tell mom that I'm a big boy.\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 68,
    "longueur_ref": 45,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_8",
    "chrf": 61.21,
    "plancher": 53.28,
    "hasard": 11.76,
    "sortie": "I can do up my buttons and tie my shoelaces.",
    "longueur_sortie": 44,
    "longueur_ref": 43,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_9",
    "chrf": 48.22,
    "plancher": 39.76,
    "hasard": 11.8,
    "sortie": "I'm telling my little brother all the gossip from school.",
    "longueur_sortie": 57,
    "longueur_ref": 57,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_10",
    "chrf": 31.39,
    "plancher": 20.62,
    "hasard": 16.0,
    "sortie": "For school, I am doing my best to study hard.",
    "longueur_sortie": 45,
    "longueur_ref": 35,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0095_11",
    "chrf": 53.76,
    "plancher": 40.84,
    "hasard": 27.31,
    "sortie": "I do plenty of things every day. But I like to play the most.",
    "longueur_sortie": 61,
    "longueur_ref": 85,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_0",
    "chrf": 40.49,
    "plancher": 40.98,
    "hasard": 7.13,
    "sortie": "Tingi stays with grandma.",
    "longueur_sortie": 25,
    "longueur_ref": 33,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_1",
    "chrf": 42.92,
    "plancher": 33.56,
    "hasard": 15.96,
    "sortie": "And she takes care of the cow with her.",
    "longueur_sortie": 39,
    "longueur_ref": 40,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_2",
    "chrf": 53.31,
    "plancher": 64.3,
    "hasard": 10.65,
    "sortie": "One day, soldiers arrive.",
    "longueur_sortie": 25,
    "longueur_ref": 26,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_3",
    "chrf": 19.6,
    "plancher": 39.72,
    "hasard": 12.27,
    "sortie": "That's not a standard phrase in any common language and seems to be a mix of words that don't form a coherent sentence in English or another widely recognized language. However, interpreting it as a pidgin or creole expression, possibly from a West African context, it could be translated as:\n\n\"They came to take the cows away.\"",
    "longueur_sortie": 328,
    "longueur_ref": 24,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_4",
    "chrf": 59.89,
    "plancher": 38.7,
    "hasard": 18.26,
    "sortie": "Tingi and my grandmother ran to come hide.",
    "longueur_sortie": 42,
    "longueur_ref": 43,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_5",
    "chrf": 73.55,
    "plancher": 36.82,
    "hasard": 10.46,
    "sortie": "They will stay in the bush until night falls.",
    "longueur_sortie": 45,
    "longueur_ref": 33,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_6",
    "chrf": 71.58,
    "plancher": 65.42,
    "hasard": 12.7,
    "sortie": "The soldiers' den came back.",
    "longueur_sortie": 28,
    "longueur_ref": 28,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_7",
    "chrf": 72.27,
    "plancher": 59.64,
    "hasard": 13.74,
    "sortie": "Grandma, come hide Tingi under the leaves.",
    "longueur_sortie": 42,
    "longueur_ref": 39,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_8",
    "chrf": 16.86,
    "plancher": 27.06,
    "hasard": 16.68,
    "sortie": "One leg on top I carry, it does not shake at all.",
    "longueur_sortie": 49,
    "longueur_ref": 65,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_9",
    "chrf": 68.01,
    "plancher": 42.56,
    "hasard": 16.05,
    "sortie": "When Dan goes out, Tingi and his grandmother come out.",
    "longueur_sortie": 54,
    "longueur_ref": 53,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   },
   {
    "article": "0210_10",
    "chrf": 30.63,
    "plancher": 16.2,
    "hasard": 16.38,
    "sortie": "The creeper went to a very small house.",
    "longueur_sortie": 39,
    "longueur_ref": 29,
    "tronque": false,
    "recopie": false
   }
  ]
 }
]